Multiple Mining Contribution Models

ColossusX can provide multiple mining models that allow node operators to contribute to the network in different ways.

1. ColossusX Miner

A ColossusX Miner performs PoW mining for KeyBlocks, which are generated approximately every 10 minutes.

If the miner’s PoW is selected for a KeyBlock, the miner receives a mining reward.

ColossusX PoW uses a large DAG of approximately 32GB, so a mining environment with sufficient memory is required.

Main Roles

* Perform PoW mining for KeyBlocks
* Earn mining rewards when the PoW is selected
* Requires an approximately 32GB DAG

⸻

2. RPC Miner

An RPC Miner operates its own node as a Public RPC endpoint.

By providing RPC access to users and dApps, and by validating and relaying incoming transactions to the network, the RPC Miner contributes to the network infrastructure.

When a transaction is submitted through that RPC endpoint, the RPC Miner can receive 20% of the transaction fee (Tx Fee) as a reward.

Since RPC Miners do not need to perform PoW mining, they do not require the 32GB DAG.

Main Roles

* Provide a Public RPC node
* Provide network access for users and dApps
* Validate and relay transactions to the network
* Earn 20% of the Tx Fee generated through the RPC endpoint
* No 32GB DAG required

⸻

3. Full Miner

A Full Miner operates as both a ColossusX Miner and an RPC Miner at the same time.

While performing PoW mining for KeyBlocks, the node can also operate as a Public RPC endpoint and participate in transaction validation and relay.

This means a Full Miner can earn both:

PoW Mining Rewards + RPC Tx Fee Rewards

Main Roles

* Perform ColossusX PoW mining
* Provide a Public RPC node
* Validate and relay transactions
* Earn PoW mining rewards
* Earn Tx Fee rewards through RPC usage
* Requires an approximately 32GB DAG

⸻

Three Mining Models

Model	PoW	Public RPC	TX Validation & Relay	32GB DAG	Reward
ColossusX Miner	✅	Optional	✅	✅ Required	PoW Reward
RPC Miner	❌	✅	✅	❌ Not Required	20% of Tx Fee
Full Miner	✅	✅	✅	✅ Required	PoW Reward + RPC Reward

With this model, network participation is not limited to users with high-performance mining hardware.

Users operating standard servers can also contribute to the network by providing RPC infrastructure, validating transactions, and relaying them to the network, while earning rewards for their contribution.

In other words, ColossusX can reward both computational contribution and network infrastructure contribution.
